{"key": "911b6a67e2669bb529d541bbae4253b5f79f0958", "kind": "faithfulness", "ref": "d3_fact_01#probe-fabricate", "result": {"declined": false, "sentences": [{"support": "full", "by": ["3_c0001", "3_c0000"], "quote": "Hydrotronic 控制器用于控制  \nLeader 离心泵的自动运行"}, {"support": "full", "by": ["3_c0001", "3_c0000"], "quote": "当出水侧的阀门打开时，泵将启动；当阀门关闭时，泵将停止"}, {"support": "full", "by": ["3_c0001", "3_c0000"], "quote": "Hydrotronic 还提供空载保护功能，即在无水条件下，其不允许泵运行"}, {"support": "full", "by": ["3_c0001", "3_c0000"], "quote": "Ecotronic 系列在出厂时即配备此控制器"}, {"support": "full", "by": ["3_c0001", "3_c0000"], "quote": "Hydrotronic 适用于所有非自动Leader 离心泵，例如：Ecoplus或 Ecojet 系列"}, {"support": "none", "by": [], "quote": ""}]}}
