{"key": "94e49d2b042ec3888f84c2e642b58dbbae32bdcd", "kind": "faithfulness", "ref": "d1_coll_02#probe-fabricate", "result": {"declined": false, "sentences": [{"support": "full", "by": ["2_c0040"], "quote": "如有霜冻的危险，排空所有的泵和不用的管路，或采取其它措施防止霜冻"}, {"support": "full", "by": ["2_c0040"], "quote": "如输送含杂质液体，为防止腐蚀，泵停用时应排空，必要时清洗"}, {"support": "full", "by": ["2_c0002"], "quote": "长期存放(3 个月以上)，需做专门处理"}, {"support": "none", "by": [], "quote": ""}]}}
{"key": "9627e6d1310c36134e24e8139f9ed2c4d3edabf3", "kind": "faithfulness", "ref": "d3_fact_07#probe-fabricate", "result": {"declined": false, "sentences": [{"support": "full", "by": ["3_c0005"], "quote": "每周至少清洁一次进水口区域，以确保其保持清洁、无碎屑。"}, {"support": "none", "by": [], "quote": ""}]}}
{"key": "9afaa422951f3080620299741e3326ebbc137327", "kind": "faithfulness", "ref": "d1_fact_08#probe-fabricate", "result": {"declined": false, "sentences": [{"support": "full", "by": ["1_c0009"], "quote": "压力：≥泵进口压力+0.2MPa，如果泵为首级双吸结构压力≥泵单级扬程+进口压力+0.2MPa"}, {"support": "none", "by": [], "quote": ""}]}}
